# Never pushed, ever — no .md file of any kind reaches the remote. Explicit,
# repeated instruction. Local-only planning/summary/runbook docs.
*.md

# Real secret values never get committed — only the *-secrets.example.yaml
# placeholders (key names, no values) live in git. See docs/secrets-inventory.md.
*-secrets.yaml
*.secrets.yaml
environments/**/*-secrets.yaml
.env

# SOPS+age plaintext scratch file - only ever exists on disk transiently
# while creating/editing environments/local-okd/app-secrets.sops.env;
# the committed file is the ciphertext, this is not.
environments/local-okd/app-secrets.plaintext.env

# age private key, if you ever keep a local copy inside this checkout
# instead of the OS-level default location - sops's real default lookup
# path is already outside the repo (%AppData%\sops\age\keys.txt on
# Windows); this is a defensive backstop only.
*.agekey

# Local tooling state
.vault-token
kubeconfig
*.kubeconfig
charts/**/charts/
charts/**/Chart.lock

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
